# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js

# testing
/coverage

# production
# NOTE: frontend/build IS committed to git on purpose. server.py / run_server.py
# serve it directly so the app needs no Node.js or Yarn install to run, including
# for anyone who gets this project via `git clone` or GitHub's "Download ZIP" -
# both skip anything gitignored, so if this stayed ignored the app would have
# nothing to serve outside of the maintainer's own hand-built download package.
# Run `yarn build` after editing frontend source, then commit the new build/.

# misc
.DS_Store
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
